><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Kastenbauer</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Naumann</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cartilage tissue engineering with novel non-woven structured biomaterial based on hyaluronic acid benzyl ester</article-title><source>J Biomed Mater Res</source><year>1998</year><volume>42</volume><fpage>172</fpage><lpage>181</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9773813</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/(SICI)1097-4636(199811)42:2&#x0003c;172::AID-JBM2&#x0003e;3.0.CO;2-M</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brun</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Abatangelo</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Radice</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Zacchi</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Guidolin</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Daga Gordini</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Cortivo</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Chondrocyte aggregation and reorganization into three-dimentional scaffolds</article-title><source>J Biomed Mater Res</source><year>1999</year><volume>46</volume><fpage>337</fpage><lpage>346</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10397990</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/(SICI)1097-4636(19990905)46:3&#x0003c;337::AID-JBM5&#x0003e;3.0.CO;2-Q</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Radice</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Brun</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Cortivo</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Scapinelli</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Bataillard</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Abatangelo</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Hyaluronan-based biopolymers as delivery vehicles for bone-marrow-derived mesenchymal progenitors</article-title><source>J Biomed Mater Res</source><year>2000</year><volume>50</volume><fpage>101</fpage><lpage>109</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10679672</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/(SICI)1097-4636(200005)50:2&#x0003c;101::AID-JBM2&#x0003e;3.0.CO;2-M</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Grigolo</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Lisignoli</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Piacentini</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Fiorini</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Gobbi</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Mazzotti</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Duca</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Pavesio</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Facchini</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Evidence for re-differentiation of human chondrocytes grown on a hyaluronan-based biomaterial (HYAFF-11): molecular, immunohistochemical and ultrastructural analysis</article-title><source>Biomaterials</source><year>2002</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>1187</fpage><lpage>1195</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11791922</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0142-9612(01)00236-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Girotto</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Urbani</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Brun</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Renier</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Barbucci</